                            <comment id="13614400" author="ikelly" created="Tue, 26 Mar 2013 18:29:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have two plans to fix this. Firstly, the autorecovery daemon shouldn&apos;t take down the bookie, even if it has gone down itself. Secondly, it shouldn&apos;t go down itself on sync disconnected. Fixing the former will be very straight forward. The latter may be tricky.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
